<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy | shadiAmour</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Read shadiAmour's Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal data in line with UK GDPR.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://shadiamour.com/privacy" />

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/images/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/images/site.webmanifest">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#00113a">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css">
  <link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/remixicon/4.6.0/remixicon.min.css" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
  <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/remixicon/4.6.0/remixicon.min.css"></noscript>
  <%- include('partials/clarity') %>
  <%- include('partials/thirdparty') %>
  <%- include('partials/analytics') %>

  <style>
    .policy-body h2 {
      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #00113a;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .policy-body h3 {
      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #00113a;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .policy-body p { color: #444650; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .policy-body ul, .policy-body ol { margin: 1rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: #444650; }
    .policy-body ul { list-style-type: disc; }
    .policy-body ol { list-style-type: decimal; }
    .policy-body li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .policy-body strong { color: #1a1b20; }
    .policy-body a { color: #002366; text-decoration: underline; transition: color 0.3s ease; }
    .policy-body a:hover { color: #003399; }
    .policy-body blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #C5A059; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; background: #f4f3f9; border-radius: 0.5rem; color: #444650; font-style: italic; }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-background text-on-background font-body-md antialiased flex flex-col min-h-screen">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="flex-grow pt-[92px] pb-16">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-secondary-container/20 border border-secondary-container/40 rounded-full text-secondary font-label-md text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        <i class="ri-shield-user-line"></i>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Read shadiAmour's Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal data in line with UK GDPR.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy -->
    <section class="px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto pb-section-padding">
      <div class="bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="policy-body">
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6"><em>Last updated: 10 August 2026</em></p>
          <p>shadiAmour ("we," "us," "our") operates shadiamour.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal data when you use our matchmaking platform, in accordance with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.</p>

          <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p>shadiAmour is operated by shadiAmour Ltd, registered in England &amp; Wales (Company No. [COMPANY NUMBER]), registered office at London, United Kingdom. We are the data controller for the personal data described in this policy.</p>

          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Profile information:</strong> name, age, gender, location, religious practice, marital background, education, profession, family details, and preferences you provide when creating or updating your profile.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact details:</strong> email address, phone number.</li>
            <li><strong>Communications data:</strong> messages sent through our platform's chat feature, connection requests, and consultation bookings.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and cookies (see our Cookie section below).</li>
            <li><strong>Special category data:</strong> because this is a faith-based matrimonial platform, some information you provide (e.g. religious practice, sect) may be considered "special category data" under UK GDPR. We only collect this because you choose to share it as part of creating a matrimonial profile, and we rely on your explicit consent as the lawful basis for processing it.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use your data to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Create and display your matchmaking profile to other verified members</li>
            <li>Match you with compatible profiles</li>
            <li>Verify your identity and moderate profiles for authenticity and safety</li>
            <li>Provide customer support and matchmaking consultations</li>
            <li>Send service updates and, where you've opted in, marketing communications</li>
            <li>Maintain the security of the platform and prevent fraud or misuse</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Lawful Basis for Processing</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Consent</strong> — for special category data (religious/marital details) and marketing communications</li>
            <li><strong>Contract</strong> — to provide the matchmaking service you've signed up for</li>
            <li><strong>Legitimate interest</strong> — for fraud prevention, platform security, and service improvement</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>5. Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Other members:</strong> your profile is visible to verified members based on your privacy settings; your phone number and full contact details are never shared without your consent.</li>
            <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> we use third-party providers (e.g. hosting, payment processing, email delivery) who process data on our behalf under data processing agreements.</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp groups:</strong> if you opt in to have your profile shared in our community WhatsApp groups, be aware WhatsApp is a third-party platform with its own privacy terms.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal requirements:</strong> we may disclose data where required by law or to protect the safety of our members.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

          <h2>6. Parent/Guardian-Created Profiles</h2>
          <p>Where a parent or guardian creates a profile on behalf of a family member, the family member's consent should be obtained before publishing, and the family member has the same rights described in this policy over their own data.</p>

          <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, we will delete or anonymise your personal data within 30 days, except where we're required to retain it for legal, safety, or fraud-prevention purposes.</p>

          <h2>8. Your Rights Under UK GDPR</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
            <li>Restrict or object to certain processing</li>
            <li>Data portability</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time (e.g. opting out of marketing, or removing special category data)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com">contact@shadiamour.com</a>.</p>

          <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
          <p>We use cookies to keep you logged in, remember preferences, and understand site usage. You can control cookies through your browser settings. See our full Cookie Policy for details on the specific cookies we use.</p>

          <h2>10. International Data Transfers</h2>
          <p>If any of our service providers are based outside the UK/EEA, we ensure appropriate safeguards (such as Standard Contractual Clauses) are in place.</p>

          <h2>11. Children</h2>
          <p>shadiAmour is not intended for anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.</p>

          <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be notified to members via email or a platform notice.</p>

          <h2>13. Contact &amp; Complaints</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com">contact@shadiamour.com</a>.</p>
          <p>If you're unhappy with how we've handled your data, you also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) at ico.org.uk.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>